{"id":"98b9feb035179dfc","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-girsanov.md","title":"Girsanov Theorem","display":"df-girsanov — Girsanov Theorem","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-girsanov","aliases":["58-df-girsanov","Girsanov Theorem","Change of Measure"],"display":"df-girsanov — Girsanov Theorem","depends_on":["[[58-df-progressive-ito-data.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-radon-nikodym.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-brownian-motion.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-stochastic-integral-data.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-girsanov"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-girsanov</span><span>Girsanov Theorem</span><span>Change of Measure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-girsanov — Girsanov Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9b271ecc61952593\" href=\"?note=9b271ecc61952593\" title=\"58-df-progressive-ito-data.md\">58-df-progressive-ito-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"31e71a3e39e9a1b8\" href=\"?note=31e71a3e39e9a1b8\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-radon-nikodym.md\">../batch02/58-df-radon-nikodym.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"948f8f3178040b74\" href=\"?note=948f8f3178040b74\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-brownian-motion.md\">../batch14/58-df-brownian-motion.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b91a21e76d0947e0\" href=\"?note=b91a21e76d0947e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-stochastic-integral-data.md\">../batch03/58-df-stochastic-integral-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb P,\\mathbb Q,W,W^{\\mathbb Q},\\theta,Z,T\\in V\">\\(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb P,\\mathbb Q,W,W^{\\mathbb Q},\\theta,Z,T\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb T=\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\">\\(\\mathbb T=\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W,W^{\\mathbb Q},\\theta\">\\(W,W^{\\mathbb Q},\\theta\\)</span> 均使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb T\\to\\mathbb R^\\Omega\">\\(\\mathbb T\\to\\mathbb R^\\Omega\\)</span> 的过程编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span> 的时间域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[0,T]\">\\([0,T]\\)</span>。保留原十参数关系及密度指数的负号约定。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProgressivelyMeasurable}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ProgressivelyMeasurable}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProgressiveItoIntegral58}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ProgressiveItoIntegral58}_S\\)</span> 与共同事件上的连续性取自新增内部依赖；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BrownianWithFiltration}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BrownianWithFiltration}_S\\)</span> 要求相对于指定滤过的增量独立性。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda_t\">\\(\\lambda_t\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[0,t]\">\\([0,t]\\)</span> 上限制 Lebesgue 测度，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_+\">\\(\\mathcal B_+\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[0,\\infty]\">\\([0,\\infty]\\)</span> 的 Borel <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-代数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exp(\\infty)=\\infty\">\\(\\exp(\\infty)=\\infty\\)</span>。所有非负积分使用 <code>58-df-integral</code>；实时间积分使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TimeIntegralValue}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TimeIntegralValue}_S\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_\\theta(t,w)=\\int_{[0,t]}\\{\\langle s,\\theta(s)(w)^2\\rangle:s\\in[0,t]\\}\\,d\\lambda_t\">\\(\\mathcal E_\\theta(t,w)=\\int_{[0,t]}\\{\\langle s,\\theta(s)(w)^2\\rangle:s\\in[0,t]\\}\\,d\\lambda_t\\)</span>，定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in(\\mathbb R^\\Omega)^{\\mathbb T}\">\\(\\theta\\in(\\mathbb R^\\Omega)^{\\mathbb T}\\)</span> 逐步可测、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathbb T,w\\in\\Omega\">\\(t\\in\\mathbb T,w\\in\\Omega\\)</span>；其值允许 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+\\infty\">\\(+\\infty\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RNDerivative}\">\\(\\mathrm{RNDerivative}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"31e71a3e39e9a1b8\" href=\"?note=31e71a3e39e9a1b8\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-radon-nikodym.md\">../batch02/58-df-radon-nikodym.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RealRandomVariable}\">\\(\\mathrm{RealRandomVariable}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b91a21e76d0947e0\" href=\"?note=b91a21e76d0947e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-stochastic-integral-data.md\">../batch03/58-df-stochastic-integral-data.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measurable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Measurable}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}\">\\(\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"948f8f3178040b74\" href=\"?note=948f8f3178040b74\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-brownian-motion.md\">../batch14/58-df-brownian-motion.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FiniteHorizonContinuous58}\">\\(\\mathrm{FiniteHorizonContinuous58}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"9b271ecc61952593\" href=\"?note=9b271ecc61952593\" title=\"58-df-progressive-ito-data.md\">58-df-progressive-ito-data.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GirsanovTransform}\">\\(\\mathrm{GirsanovTransform}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{GirsanovTransform}_S(\\mathbb Q,Z,W^{\\mathbb Q};\\mathbb P,W,\\theta,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,T)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;T\\in\\mathbb T\\land\\mathrm{BrownianWithFiltration}_S(W,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{ProgressivelyMeasurable}_S(\\theta,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\n\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mathbb Q,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S\\!\\left(\\{\\langle w,\\exp(\\mathcal E_\\theta(T,w)/2)\\rangle:w\\in\\Omega\\};\n(\\Omega,\\mathcal F),([0,\\infty],\\mathcal B_+)\\right)\n\\land\\int_\\Omega\\{\\langle w,\\exp(\\mathcal E_\\theta(T,w)/2)\\rangle:w\\in\\Omega\\}\\,d\\mathbb P&lt;\\infty\\\\\n&amp;\\land Z\\in(\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}^{\\Omega})^{[0,T]}\n\\land\\bigl[\\forall t\\in[0,T]\\;\\mathrm{RealRandomVariable}_S(Z(t),\\Omega,\\mathcal F_\\bullet(t))\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists I\\in(\\mathbb R^\\Omega)^{[0,T]}\\;\\exists A\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathbb P(A)=1\\land\\mathrm{FiniteHorizonContinuous58}_S(I,A,T,\\Omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\bigl[\\forall t\\in[0,T]\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ProgressiveItoIntegral58}_S(I(t),\\theta,W,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\n\\land\\mathrm{RealRandomVariable}_S(I(t),\\Omega,\\mathcal F_\\bullet(t))\\bigr)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall w\\in A\\;\\Bigl(\\mathcal E_\\theta(T,w)&lt;\\infty\\land I(0)(w)=0\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\qquad\\land\\forall t\\in[0,T]\\;\\Bigl(\nZ(t)(w)=\\exp(-I(t)(w)-\\mathcal E_\\theta(t,w)/2)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{48mm}\\land\\exists a\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{TimeIntegralValue}_S(a,\\{\\langle s,\\theta(s)(w)\\rangle:s\\in[0,t]\\},t)\n\\land W^{\\mathbb Q}(t)(w)=W(t)(w)+a\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{RNDerivative}_S(Z(T),\\mathbb Q,\\mathbb P;\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}_S(W^{\\mathbb Q},\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb Q).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{GirsanovTransform}_S(\\mathbb Q,Z,W^{\\mathbb Q};\\mathbb P,W,\\theta,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,T)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;T\\in\\mathbb T\\land\\mathrm{BrownianWithFiltration}_S(W,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{ProgressivelyMeasurable}_S(\\theta,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\n\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mathbb Q,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S\\!\\left(\\{\\langle w,\\exp(\\mathcal E_\\theta(T,w)/2)\\rangle:w\\in\\Omega\\};\n(\\Omega,\\mathcal F),([0,\\infty],\\mathcal B_+)\\right)\n\\land\\int_\\Omega\\{\\langle w,\\exp(\\mathcal E_\\theta(T,w)/2)\\rangle:w\\in\\Omega\\}\\,d\\mathbb P&lt;\\infty\\\\\n&amp;\\land Z\\in(\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}^{\\Omega})^{[0,T]}\n\\land\\bigl[\\forall t\\in[0,T]\\;\\mathrm{RealRandomVariable}_S(Z(t),\\Omega,\\mathcal F_\\bullet(t))\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists I\\in(\\mathbb R^\\Omega)^{[0,T]}\\;\\exists A\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathbb P(A)=1\\land\\mathrm{FiniteHorizonContinuous58}_S(I,A,T,\\Omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\bigl[\\forall t\\in[0,T]\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ProgressiveItoIntegral58}_S(I(t),\\theta,W,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\n\\land\\mathrm{RealRandomVariable}_S(I(t),\\Omega,\\mathcal F_\\bullet(t))\\bigr)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall w\\in A\\;\\Bigl(\\mathcal E_\\theta(T,w)&lt;\\infty\\land I(0)(w)=0\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\qquad\\land\\forall t\\in[0,T]\\;\\Bigl(\nZ(t)(w)=\\exp(-I(t)(w)-\\mathcal E_\\theta(t,w)/2)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{48mm}\\land\\exists a\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{TimeIntegralValue}_S(a,\\{\\langle s,\\theta(s)(w)\\rangle:s\\in[0,t]\\},t)\n\\land W^{\\mathbb Q}(t)(w)=W(t)(w)+a\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{RNDerivative}_S(Z(T),\\mathbb Q,\\mathbb P;\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}_S(W^{\\mathbb Q},\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb Q).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>指数中的随机积分已用实际平方均值极限给出。Novikov 条件蕴含有限时域上的平方可积性，故此处无须将原接口改成局部积分接口。</li>\n<li>全时间恒等式在同一个满测度事件上陈述，不将“对每个时间几乎处处”偷换为“几乎处处对所有时间”。零测集上的不同可测版本仍允许作为关系的不同见证。</li>\n<li>保留原关系对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W^{\\mathbb Q}\">\\(W^{\\mathbb Q}\\)</span> 的全时间 Brownian 条件，并仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[0,T]\">\\([0,T]\\)</span> 指定漂移恒等式。这里没有额外断言有限时域数据必在同一样本空间上具有所要求的全时间延拓。</li>\n<li>原八批次定理只是该关系最后一项的逻辑投影；没有将其改成更强的存在性定理。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Karatzas and Shreve, Brownian Motion and Stochastic Calculus</li>\n<li>Øksendal, Stochastic Differential Equations</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-progressive-ito-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"9b271ecc61952593","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-progressive-ito-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-radon-nikodym.md","status":"resolved","id":"31e71a3e39e9a1b8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-radon-nikodym.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-brownian-motion.md","status":"resolved","id":"948f8f3178040b74","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-brownian-motion.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-stochastic-integral-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"b91a21e76d0947e0","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-stochastic-integral-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-radon-nikodym.md","status":"resolved","id":"31e71a3e39e9a1b8","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{RNDerivative}$ 取 [[../batch02/58-df-radon-nikodym.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-stochastic-integral-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"b91a21e76d0947e0","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{RealRandomVariable}$ 取 [[../batch03/58-df-stochastic-integral-data.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Measurable}$ 取 [[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Measure}$ 取 [[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-brownian-motion.md","status":"resolved","id":"948f8f3178040b74","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}$ 取 [[../batch14/58-df-brownian-motion.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-progressive-ito-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"9b271ecc61952593","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{FiniteHorizonContinuous58}$ 取 [[58-df-progressive-ito-data.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb P,\\mathbb Q,W,W^{\\mathbb Q},\\theta,Z,T\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb T=\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}","display":false},{"tex":"W,W^{\\mathbb Q},\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb T\\to\\mathbb R^\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"Z","display":false},{"tex":"[0,T]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProgressivelyMeasurable}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProgressiveItoIntegral58}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BrownianWithFiltration}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda_t","display":false},{"tex":"[0,t]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B_+","display":false},{"tex":"[0,\\infty]","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\exp(\\infty)=\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TimeIntegralValue}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E_\\theta(t,w)=\\int_{[0,t]}\\{\\langle s,\\theta(s)(w)^2\\rangle:s\\in[0,t]\\}\\,d\\lambda_t","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta\\in(\\mathbb R^\\Omega)^{\\mathbb T}","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in\\mathbb T,w\\in\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"+\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RNDerivative}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RealRandomVariable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measurable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measure}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FiniteHorizonContinuous58}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GirsanovTransform}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{GirsanovTransform}_S(\\mathbb Q,Z,W^{\\mathbb Q};\\mathbb P,W,\\theta,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,T)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&T\\in\\mathbb T\\land\\mathrm{BrownianWithFiltration}_S(W,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{ProgressivelyMeasurable}_S(\\theta,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\n\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mathbb Q,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S\\!\\left(\\{\\langle w,\\exp(\\mathcal E_\\theta(T,w)/2)\\rangle:w\\in\\Omega\\};\n(\\Omega,\\mathcal F),([0,\\infty],\\mathcal B_+)\\right)\n\\land\\int_\\Omega\\{\\langle w,\\exp(\\mathcal E_\\theta(T,w)/2)\\rangle:w\\in\\Omega\\}\\,d\\mathbb P<\\infty\\\\\n&\\land Z\\in(\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}^{\\Omega})^{[0,T]}\n\\land\\bigl[\\forall t\\in[0,T]\\;\\mathrm{RealRandomVariable}_S(Z(t),\\Omega,\\mathcal F_\\bullet(t))\\bigr]\\\\\n&\\land\\exists I\\in(\\mathbb R^\\Omega)^{[0,T]}\\;\\exists A\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathbb P(A)=1\\land\\mathrm{FiniteHorizonContinuous58}_S(I,A,T,\\Omega)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\bigl[\\forall t\\in[0,T]\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ProgressiveItoIntegral58}_S(I(t),\\theta,W,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\n\\land\\mathrm{RealRandomVariable}_S(I(t),\\Omega,\\mathcal F_\\bullet(t))\\bigr)\\bigr]\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall w\\in A\\;\\Bigl(\\mathcal E_\\theta(T,w)<\\infty\\land I(0)(w)=0\\\\\n&\\qquad\\qquad\\land\\forall t\\in[0,T]\\;\\Bigl(\nZ(t)(w)=\\exp(-I(t)(w)-\\mathcal E_\\theta(t,w)/2)\\\\\n&\\hspace{48mm}\\land\\exists a\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{TimeIntegralValue}_S(a,\\{\\langle s,\\theta(s)(w)\\rangle:s\\in[0,t]\\},t)\n\\land W^{\\mathbb Q}(t)(w)=W(t)(w)+a\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{RNDerivative}_S(Z(T),\\mathbb Q,\\mathbb P;\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}_S(W^{\\mathbb Q},\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb Q).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"W^{\\mathbb Q}","display":false},{"tex":"[0,T]","display":false}],"bytes":5053,"backlinks":[{"id":"4869eb031373ed3e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GirsanovTransform}_S:V^{10}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ and $\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch20/58-df-girsanov.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-590","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-girsanov.md|58-df-girsanov]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["9b271ecc61952593","31e71a3e39e9a1b8","948f8f3178040b74","ca832ed6bc22f728","36d7463d215be751","b91a21e76d0947e0","bbbec05fde1d3b01"]}